This repository ("yamata-bnb") contains only:

- Publicly verifiable on-chain contract addresses for Yamata deployments on BNB Smart Chain.
- Network configuration constants for BNB Smart Chain.
- A minimal verification script and TypeScript helpers that read public blockchain state.

No smart contract implementation source code, no backend code, no risk/pricing/liquidation logic, no frontend application code, and no proprietary business logic from Yamata are included.

USE OF THIS PACKAGE
The address constants and verification tooling may be used to confirm deployment and to build read-only integrations against the public contracts on BNB Smart Chain.

